    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 236,
        "text": "Good evening, everyone. Thanks for coming to the community garden meeting. I know it's late, but we have a lot to discuss. First, the good news: the new tool shed is finally built. A big thank you to everyone who helped last weekend.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ef2bd93a16e29dcd92d7cefab312c3d23bef40c9866f72e8709d13627c5c0896",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 241,
        "sourceEnd": 384,
        "text": "That's great, but we still have a problem with the water supply. The tap near the greenhouse is broken, and we can't water the plants properly.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "485ad492a92d1e069ca216f71f499caca2f847873ae048415b95b4bdb63e011b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 389,
        "sourceEnd": 573,
        "text": "Right. I've called the council, and they said they would send someone this week. But if they don't come by Friday, we'll need to fix it ourselves. Does anyone know how to repair a tap?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "7a8156a43790e81a748c70088fe5f53c6bf00577a13c3c13095b21ad93c71791",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 578,
        "sourceEnd": 631,
        "text": "My neighbour is a plumber. I can ask him if you like.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3274abf3fe6dccd2177ee0899109aebee8f01aefed114b463f7fffdeef1e4902",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 636,
        "sourceEnd": 813,
        "text": "That would be very helpful. Thanks, Sarah. Now, about the compost. Some people have been putting plastic in the compost bin. That's a real problem because it doesn't break down.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4438176f74582ee15fad52fb9cbab56abd801d582af164b7d3e7988b703e165c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 818,
        "sourceEnd": 913,
        "text": "Maybe we should put a sign on the bin. If we put a clear sign, people might pay more attention.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "75927f204a819309559acd71f163a431ff30742c07531ffbe9ffcc81d1abad43",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 918,
        "sourceEnd": 1041,
        "text": "Good idea. I'll make one. Also, we need to decide about the children's area. The wooden fence is broken, and it's not safe.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "7980f02f47fd3f6f9fa1c86023509e86afbdee4dd18d21ba4280cbae2207dd3e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1046,
        "sourceEnd": 1204,
        "text": "If we don't fix it soon, the children could get hurt. We should ask the local school if they can help. They might have a woodwork teacher who could repair it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "d97147eefda602fc2c1c7ab01589b938173343d9e996615538069e2586db7b15",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1209,
        "sourceEnd": 1395,
        "text": "That's a possibility. I'll contact the school tomorrow. Finally, the harvest festival. We need volunteers to organise it. If we have enough volunteers, we can make it a really big event.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "8961febfcdf27b31f3c354a34f4a275ca03f153ac8724588a49cc294526311f6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1400,
        "sourceEnd": 1452,
        "text": "I can help with publicity. I'll design some posters.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "87d921578a22c8b08d4c3e0310df60f47bc7615bb566c0041a76f0b24100eb61",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1457,
        "sourceEnd": 1667,
        "text": "Perfect. So, to summarise: we'll contact the council about the tap, put a sign on the compost bin, ask the school about the fence, and start planning the festival. Thanks, everyone. Let's meet again next month.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "25c50ae0f7a62b47cf343e7353842bb2fa87b546e9eb8ef61af7c3627198383f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
